# NOTE: internal/pipeline/regression_test.go was listed here and deleted in the
# same change. That combination removed the only end-to-end regression suite AND
# made re-adding it impossible without editing this file first. Restored; do not
# re-ignore source or test files here -- this list is for build outputs.

# Per-machine environment notes: sample binary paths, env var exports, memory
# limits. The same role as a .env -- AGENTS.md is the shared contract, this is
# one developer's local setup and is meaningless (and wrong) on another machine.
AGENTS-local.md

# Golden test records: SHA-256 per output file, keyed by the input binary's
# hash. These are per-machine — they depend on which sample binaries are
# installed locally (see AGENTS-local.md). The test auto-creates them with
# AOTOPSY_UPDATE_GOLDEN=1, and skips (never fails) when the env var points
# at a different binary. Do NOT commit these.
internal/pipeline/testdata/golden/*.json
